OL,3,GNEWSAExtreme weather hits Christmas
OL,4,Atree harvest
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristmas tree growers in Sussex says
OL,7,Fthey fear their harvests will be
OL,8,Faffected by a year of extreme weather.
OL,10,FFrost, drought and prolonged periods of
OL,11,Fhot weather have killed young saplings
OL,12,Fand stunted growth, and farmers have
OL,13,Fhad to find ways to protect and
OL,14,Fsupplement stock.
OL,16,FJames Wallis, who runs Sutton Hall Farm
OL,17,Fnear Lewes with his wife Ruth, said the
OL,18,Fimpact on their business had been
OL,19,Fsevere.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
